{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30004_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:450a935775bca1508ad4abfe59c5f5547a46a8c9b5cc431c1181f0cf92aa9f12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a99b6ce0e097bf65aecc15bb926521394409a9d85a02ee3662b5446b8be7138e",
      "text": "关于两位作为声优出演的那一集……\n可以请你们先过目一下这份资料吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08bcb1cf3f37266ec304746d4b3470b1034ca2da7de7d2f8a1112ac1727b3514",
      "text": "好的。我看看……\n是叫《明天跳槽去当“勇者”！》的那一集……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a73b897fdfbbeb19b7860a526cd50359206b69408c42137da64d810d53a8a4",
      "text": "……嘿，因为崇拜勇者所以去跳槽啊。\n看起来很有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da61ea780625ee21b916482375b24ecd779c7865a80a04a9cf37091b6c103485",
      "text": "但是，主角这次果然还是觉得自己可能不适合……\n而感到很不安……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67e61be77eb553176f934ecef749b813f4467aeef4c9981357b62f8621c0b4e9",
      "text": "我们要配的，\n好像就是为那样的主角加油打气的向导角色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf4f028bf946daee4911b71732a3f63113b2c5107b1894356c0e5c2e0386c361",
      "text": "责任重大啊。\n不过……好像很有趣！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aff79da30c7f87812190047eab570b6521d6086ca37f03c8f70938e28679bfe",
      "text": "就是说啊！\n我们会努力试试看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e229159e508397b4800fc10652cb4e544130430aadc767197599a98ba5b2fc",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n录音的具体日期等安排，之后会再联络你们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ff0dd23de380f3675ab84bbb70f96ffac495e133bf7cd7f404fe02806ad98f7",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢！\n享介，回家之后开个作战会议吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:719887cadeb7d12510219d5a5db8929a1cc2b831f8d3cdd00b6364dd4abcee0b",
      "text": "嗯，当然！\n虽然是第一次难免会紧张，但一定要好好干一场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba826571fd0a98081f59d5996dc8bad8a10f10b822397b4bb4fd4b6d0b53025",
      "text": "让我们给看动画的观众们\n一个大大的惊喜吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
